,"text":"1.2 Principles underpinning inclusivity are integrated into all work practices.","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[90.1,211.39,508.14,223.72],"text":"1.3 The training and/or assessment organization’s access and equity policy is used in","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.1,223.99,181.49,236.32],"text":"work practices","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[90.1,236.59,467.69,248.92],"text":"1.4 Verbal and body language is sensitized considering different cultures and","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.1,249.31,459.19,261.64],"text":"backgrounds and differences in physical and intellectual abilities and as","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.1,261.91,169.85,274.24],"text":"appropriate.","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[90.1,312.91,145.13,325.24],"text":"Overview","size":11.04,"bold":true},{"bbox":[90.1,338.35,503.58,350.68],"text":"Inclusivity means recognising, accommodating and meeting the learning needs of all","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[90.1,350.95,498.53,363.28],"text":"your learners. It means acknowledging that your learners have a range of individual","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[90.1,363.67,376.25,376.0],"text":"learning needs and are members of diverse communities.","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[90.1,388.99,468.05,401.32],"text":"Inclusivity embraces the idea that since everyone is an individual, we need to","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[90.1,401.59,479.69,413.92],"text":"organise teaching and learning environment so that each learner has a learning","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[90.1,414.19,193.49,426.52],"text":"experience that ‘fits’.","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[90.1,439.51,314.57,451.84],"text":"An inclusive learning environment is one that:","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.1,464.44,116.21,477.97],"text":"·","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.1,465.55,278.33,477.88],"text":"values and respects difference","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.1,477.88,116.21,491.41],"text":"·","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.1,478.99,217.25,491.32],"text":"promotes learning","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.1,491.2,116.21,504.73],"text":"·","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.1,492.31,457.61,504.64],"text":"supports and advises colleagues, learners and clients to encourage","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.1,505.03,395.21,517.36],"text":"new and ongoing participation in learning opportunities","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.1,517.24,116.21,530.77],"text":"·","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.1,518.35,419.09,530.68],"text":"explores the benefits of learning with colleagues and clients","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.1,530.68,116.21,544.21],"text":"·","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.1,531.79,467.33,544.12],"text":"recognises and rewards learning and competency achievement in the","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.1,544.39,292.49,556.72],"text":"work and/or learning environment","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.1,556.72,116.21,570.25],"text":"·","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.1,557.83,461.57,570.16],"text":"provides opportunities to develop your own and others' generic skills","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.1,570.04,116.21,583.57],"text":"·","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.1,571.15,463.97,583.48],"text":"offers multiple pathways to achieve your own and others' current and","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.1,583.87,321.77,596.2],"text":"future professional development needs.","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[90.1,621.67,225.17,634.0],"text":"Why practice inclusivity?","size":11.04,"bold":true},{"bbox":[90.1,647.11,501.9,659.44],"text":"By fostering and promoting an inclusive learning culture, training and/or assessment","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[90.1,659.71,176.93,672.04],"text":"organization can:","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.1,684.64,116.21,698.17],"text":"·","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.1,685.75,510.17,698.08],"text":"Prepare its learners to work more effectively and flexibly in diverse workplaces","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.1,698.47,212.33,710.8],"text":"and communities","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.1,710.68,116.21,724.21],"text":"·","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.1,711.79,451.98,724.12],"text":"Provide more learners and clients with better quality services in an","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.1,724.51,285.77,736.84],"text":"increasingly competitive market","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.1,736.72,116.21,750.25],"text":"·","size":11.04,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.1,737.83,463.61,750.16],"text":"Ensure it meets its obligations arising out of legislation and standard","size":11.04,"bold":false}],"images":0,"annots":[{"xref":4029,"type":"Highlight","rect":[90.08,440.95,311.28,491.98],"quads":[[90.08,440.95,311.28,451.96],[108.1,466.97,275.24,477.97],[108.1,479.97,208.18,491.98]],"color":[1.0,0.94,0.4],"content":""},{"xref":4073,"type":"Highlight","rect":[90.27,340.3,499.79,363.25],"quads":[[91.12,340.3,499.79,350.65],[90.27,353.03,156.41,363.25]],"color":[1.0,0.96,0.0],"content":""},{"xref":4077,"type":"Highlight","rect":[371.03,352.9,494.74,363.25],"quads":[[371.03,352.9,494.74,363.25]],"color":[1.0,0.96,0.0],"content":""},{"xref":4080,"type":"Highlight","rect":[90.8,365.62,369.29,375.97],"quads":[[90.8,365.62,369.29,375.97]],"color":[1.0,0.96,0.0],"content":""},{"xref":4083,"type":"Highlight","rect":[90.46,403.67,304.17,413.89],"quads":[[90.46,403.67,304.17,413.89]],"color":[1.0,0.96,0.0],"content":""},{"xref":4086,"type":"Highlight","rect":[126.44,494.39,285.4,504.61],"quads":[[126.44,494.39,285.4,504.61]],"color":[1.0,0.96,0.0],"content":""},{"xref":4089,"type":"Highlight","rect":[126.83,494.39,454.24,517.33],"quads":[[286.74,494.39,454.24,504.61],[126.83,507.11,391.72,517.33]],"color":[1.0,0.96,0.0],"content":""},{"xref":4093,"type":"Highlight","rect":[108.67,496.45,136.96,502.42],"quads":[[108.67,496.45,136.96,502.42]],"